{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "c100000000000001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 3500,
      "height": 980,
      "label": "一阶线性化与方向几何"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000002",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 2200,
      "height": 900,
      "label": "二阶方向响应与局部曲率"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000003",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2280,
      "width": 3500,
      "height": 950,
      "label": "隐式解支、局部可逆性与体积"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 3500,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "# 多元微分\n\n这张图把一点附近的小扰动分成三层：统一的一阶线性化、Hessian 控制的二阶方向响应，以及 Jacobian 正则性带来的隐式解支、局部逆与体积变化。\n\n**箭头只表示明确的定义依赖、推出、特化或边界关系；颜色区分语义角色，不表示掌握度。**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[偏导数|Partial derivative]]\nHold other inputs fixed. The finite two-sided limit of the coordinate quotient gives this coordinate rate.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**偏导数**：固定其余输入；坐标差商的有限双侧极限给出该坐标变化率。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[偏导不可推可微|Partial-derivative boundary]]\nAll coordinate rates may exist while the function is discontinuous. The candidate linear map need not give a uniform small remainder.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**偏导不可推可微**：各坐标偏导都存在，函数仍可能不连续；候选线性映射未必满足统一小余项条件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[全微分|Total differential]]\nOne linear map $L$ satisfies $f(a+h)-f(a)=Lh+r(h)$, with $\\|r(h)\\|/\\|h\\|\\to0$ over all nonzero small displacements.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**全微分**：同一个线性映射 $L$ 近似所有小位移的输出变化；余项相对位移的比值趋于零。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Jacobian矩阵|Jacobian matrix]]\nFor $f:\\mathbb R^n\\to\\mathbb R^m$, the partial-derivative array is $m\\times n$. Under differentiability it represents $Df$; only a square array has a determinant.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Jacobian矩阵**：$n$ 个输入、$m$ 个输出给出 $m\\times n$ 偏导矩阵；可微时它表示全微分，只有方阵才有行列式。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1640,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多元链式法则|Multivariable chain rule]]\nIf $g$ is differentiable at $a$ and $f$ at $g(a)$, then $J_{f\\circ g}(a)=J_f(g(a))J_g(a)$. The outer map multiplies on the left.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**多元链式法则**：$g$ 在 $a$、$f$ 在 $g(a)$ 可微时，复合的 Jacobian 按“外乘内”的顺序相乘。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[方向导数|Directional derivative]]\nFix $v$ and differentiate $t\\mapsto f(a+tv)$ at $0$. This finite two-sided rate is per unit parameter; unit $v$ gives a per-distance rate.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**方向导数**：固定 $v$，对直线路径参数求零点处有限双侧导数；向量不必单位化，单位向量才给每距离变化率。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000014",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[方向导数梯度公式|Gradient formula]]\nFor scalar $f$ differentiable at $a$, $D_vf(a)=\\nabla f(a)^Tv$ for every fixed vector $v$. The zero vector gives rate $0$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**方向导数梯度公式**：实值函数在该点可微时，各固定向量的变化率等于梯度点积；向量可非单位，零向量给零。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000020",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[方向导数尺度|Scaling a direction]]\nIf the finite two-sided $D_vf(a)$ exists, $D_{cv}f(a)=cD_vf(a)$ for real $c$. Unit length removes speed; it does not supply differentiability.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**方向导数尺度**：有限双侧方向导数按实数倍缩放；单位化排除参数速度差异，不会提供可微假设。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[梯度最陡方向|Euclidean steepest ascent]]\nAt a differentiable point with $g=\\nabla f(a)\\ne0$, $g/\\|g\\|_2$ maximizes first-order change over Euclidean unit vectors. For $g=0$, all tie.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**梯度最陡方向**：可微且梯度非零时，归一化梯度在欧氏单位向量中使一阶上升最快；梯度为零时全部并列。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000021",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1640,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[最陡方向依赖度量|Metric steepness]]\nFor differentiable $f$, let $g=\\nabla f(a)\\ne0$. If $M$ is real symmetric positive-definite, steepest ascent is along $M^{-1}g$, normalized by $v^TMv=1$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**度量与最陡方向**：可微且梯度非零时，实对称正定 $M$ 下的最陡上升沿 $M^{-1}g$，以 $v^TMv=1$ 归一化。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2020,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[梯度与水平集|Gradients and level sets]]\nFor scalar $f\\in C^1$ near $a$ with $\\nabla f(a)\\ne0$, the level set is locally regular and its tangent space is $\\ker Df(a)$. The gradient is normal.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**梯度与水平集**：实值 $f$ 在 $a$ 附近为 $C^1$ 且梯度非零时，水平集局部正则，切空间等于导数的核；梯度给出法向量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000022",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[零梯度不定切空间|When the gradient is zero]]\nAt a differentiable point with zero gradient, the linear equation accepts every velocity. The level set may still be a point, crossing branches or a smooth line; inspect its geometry.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**零梯度不定切空间**：可微点的梯度为零时，线性方程接受所有速度；实际水平集却可能是一点、交叉分支或光滑直线，需另看几何。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000015",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[方向导数不可推可微|Directional-derivative boundary]]\nRates on all fixed lines need not be linear. Even if every rate is $0$, curved approaches can defeat the uniform small-remainder requirement.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**方向导数不可推可微**：各固定直线的变化率未必线性；即使全部为零，曲线趋近仍可能使统一小余项条件失败。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Hessian矩阵|Hessian matrix]]\nFor scalar $f$, entry $(i,j)$ is $\\partial_j(\\partial_i f)$ when these partials exist. This array represents the derivative of $\\nabla f$ when the gradient map is differentiable.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Hessian矩阵**：实值函数的二阶偏导组成方阵，第 $(i,j)$ 项先对 $i$ 再对 $j$ 求导；梯度映射可微时，它表示梯度的全导数。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000023",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Hessian方向二阶导数|Line second derivative]]\nFor scalar $f\\in C^2$ near $a$ and fixed $v$, set $\\phi(t)=f(a+tv)$. Then $\\phi^{\\prime\\prime}(0)=v^TH_f(a)v$; replacing $v$ by $cv$ multiplies this by $c^2$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Hessian方向二阶导数**：实值 $f$ 在 $a$ 附近为 $C^2$ 时，沿固定向量 $v$ 的直线二阶导数为 Hessian 二次型；向量放大 $c$ 倍，结果乘 $c^2$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多元Taylor近似|Second-order Taylor]]\nFor scalar $f\\in C^2$ near $a$, displacement $h$ gives a gradient linear term and quadratic term $h^TH_f(a)h/2$, with remainder $o(\\|h\\|^2)$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**多元Taylor近似**：实值 $f$ 在 $a$ 附近为 $C^2$ 时，小位移带来梯度线性项、Hessian 二次项的一半，以及相对位移平方趋零的余项。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000016",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 1720,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Hessian对称条件|Hessian symmetry]]\nContinuous second partials near a point guarantee a symmetric Hessian. Their existence only at that point does not; this continuity test is sufficient, not necessary.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Hessian对称条件**：邻域内二阶偏导连续保证 Hessian 对称；仅在一点存在不够。这是充分检验，不是对称性的必要条件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c300000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 1720,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Hessian 局部极小判据|Hessian minimum test]]\nFor real scalar $f\\in C^2$ near an interior stationary point $a$, positive-definite $H_f(a)$ guarantees a strict local minimum. This is sufficient, not necessary.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Hessian 局部极小判据**：实值函数在内点驻点附近为 $C^2$，且 Hessian 正定，便有严格局部极小。这是充分条件，不是必要条件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 1720,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Hessian 局部极大判据|Hessian maximum test]]\nFor real scalar $f\\in C^2$ near an interior stationary point $a$, negative-definite $H_f(a)$ guarantees a strict local maximum; global maximality needs a separate argument.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Hessian 局部极大判据**：实值函数在内点驻点附近为 $C^2$，且 Hessian 负定，便有严格局部极大；并不自动成为全局最大。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 1720,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Hessian 鞍点判据|Hessian saddle test]]\nFor real scalar $f\\in C^2$ near an interior stationary point, an indefinite Hessian gives higher and lower values arbitrarily nearby. This sufficient test requires at least two dimensions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Hessian 鞍点判据**：实值函数在内点驻点附近为 $C^2$，且 Hessian 不定，便在任意近处都有更高与更低值。这个充分检验适用于至少二维。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c300000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1640,
      "y": 1720,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[半定Hessian无结论|Singular semidefinite Hessians]]\nAt an interior stationary point of a real $C^2$ function, singular semidefiniteness leaves classification incomplete. A nonzero positive-semidefinite Hessian still rules out a local maximum.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**半定Hessian无结论**：实值 $C^2$ 函数在内点驻点的奇异半定 Hessian 不能完成分类；但非零半正定仍排除局部极大。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 2440,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[隐函数定理|Implicit functions]]\nFor a $C^1$ system $F(u,v)=0$ near a solution, an invertible square block $D_vF$ at that solution gives exactly one $C^1$ local graph $v=g(u)$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**隐函数定理**：方程组在已知零点附近为 $C^1$，且该点待解变量块 $D_vF$ 是可逆方阵，就得到唯一的局部 $C^1$ 图像 $v=g(u)$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000024",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 2440,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[隐函数导数公式|The implicit derivative]]\n\nWith the theorem’s $C^1$ and invertibility conditions, $Dg=-(D_vF)^{-1}D_uF$; multiplication order matters.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n局部可导解支成立后，从左侧求逆；先匹配矩阵尺寸与次序。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c300000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 2440,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## [[隐函数比较静态]]\n外部应用\n\n把最优性系统写成隐式方程后，用导数公式追踪局部选择分支。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000025",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 2740,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[隐函数奇异块不推无解支|Singular implicit blocks]]\nA singular solved-variable block removes this theorem’s guarantee and inverse formula. A unique smooth branch can still exist: $v^3-u^3=0$ gives $v=u$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**隐函数奇异块不推无解支**：待解变量块奇异时，定理保证及块求逆公式不再适用；仍可能有唯一光滑解支，例如 $v^3-u^3=0$ 的 $v=u$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c300000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 2440,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Jacobian行列式|Jacobian determinant]]\nFor a differentiable real map $\\mathbb R^n\\to\\mathbb R^n$, $\\det J$ scales the derivative’s signed volume; $|\\det J|$ scales ordinary volume. This is local linear geometry.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Jacobian行列式**：实映射同维且可微时，$\\det J$ 缩放导数的有向体积，$|\\det J|$ 缩放普通体积；这是局部线性几何。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000017",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1900,
      "y": 2340,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多元换元公式|Change of variables]]\nBetween same-dimensional open sets, a $C^1$ diffeomorphism uses $|\\det DT|$ to transform integrals of continuous, absolutely integrable functions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**多元换元公式**：同维开集间的 $C^1$ 微分同胚，用 $|\\det DT|$ 换算连续且绝对可积函数的积分。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000018",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1900,
      "y": 2640,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[逆函数定理|Inverse function theorem]]\nFor a $C^1$ map between open subsets of $\\mathbb R^n$, an invertible derivative at $a$ gives a $C^1$ local inverse near its output.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**逆函数定理**：实数同维开域间的 $C^1$ 映射，若在 $a$ 的导数可逆，则在相应局部开邻域间有 $C^1$ 逆。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c200000000000019",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2280,
      "y": 2640,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Jacobian奇异不推局部非单射|Singular derivatives]]\nSingular $DF(a)$ for a differentiable square map excludes a differentiable local inverse. Injectivity and a continuous inverse can remain: $x^3$ at $0$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Jacobian奇异不推局部非单射**：同维映射可微而导数奇异，便排除相应点处可微的局部逆；仍可能单射且有连续逆，如零点附近的 $x^3$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c300000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 2940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩形Jacobian体积因子|Rectangular volume factor]]\nFor a real derivative $J\\in\\mathbb R^{m\\times k}$, $1\\le k\\le m$, $\\sqrt{\\det(J^TJ)}$ scales $k$-volume. It is positive exactly at full column rank; global coverage needs a separate check.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**矩形Jacobian体积因子**：实导数为 $m\\times k$ 且 $1\\le k\\le m$ 时，Gram 因子缩放 $k$ 维体积；满列秩时才为正，全局覆盖须另查。"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 3300,
      "width": 3500,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## 阅读路线\n\n先用偏导与方向导数获取局部切片信息，再以全微分统一所有一阶扰动；Hessian 的方向二阶响应进入 Taylor 近似和驻点分类；最后根据 Jacobian 的形状与正则性区分隐式解支、局部逆和体积公式。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sofp-cross",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3670,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[坐标二阶导数不确定Hessian|Recovering mixed entries]]\nFor real $C^2$ scalar functions in $n\\ge2$, axis second derivatives give only the Hessian diagonal. Measurements along $e_i+e_j$, together with the axes, recover the mixed entries.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**坐标二阶导数不确定Hessian**：实值 $C^2$ 函数在至少二维时，坐标轴二阶导数只给对角项；再测 $e_i+e_j$，可结合轴向值恢复混合项。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sofp-linebound",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 3670,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[逐条直线极小不推局部极小|Linewise minima]]\nEach fixed line may have its own small interval of minimality. A local minimum needs one ball for every approach; a curved path can still decrease the value.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**逐条直线极小不推局部极小**：每条固定直线可以各自有一个极小区间；局部极小却要求所有趋近共享同一个球。弯曲路径仍可能使函数下降。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sofp-qhessian",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 3670,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[二次型的Hessian|Quadratic Hessians]]\nFor fixed real $A$ and $q(x)=x^TAx$, $H_q=A+A^T$. If $A$ is symmetric this is $2A$; the Hessian of $\\tfrac12x^TAx$ is then $A$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**二次型的Hessian**：固定实矩阵 $A$ 给出 $H_q=A+A^T$；对称时为 $2A$。若函数前有 $\\tfrac12$，对称情形的 Hessian 就是 $A$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sofp-inner-bound",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 3670,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Cauchy–Schwarz不等式|Cauchy–Schwarz inequality]]\n\nReal vectors satisfy $|u^Tv|\\le\\|u\\|_2\\|v\\|_2$. Applied to $h,Bh$, this bounds a quadratic remainder.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n用于$h$与$Bh$，再结合谱范数，即可控制二次余项。"
    }
  ],
